# Public Thoroughfare: the permanent tapped may be a land. Bot1 has an untapped Island on turn 3 (the Thoroughfare is played on its second land
# drop) and taps it: the Thoroughfare stays, tapped, and the Island is tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Public Thoroughfare
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Public Thoroughfare.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.PayCost
Bot1.Choose(Island)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Public Thoroughfare.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
